pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
- elementId: top-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-bg
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 14, 120, 22]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 14, 120, 22]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      CH11
- elementId: bg-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 40, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
- elementId: bg-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 80, 1160, 230]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <ul>
      <li>早期 encrypted VM 面临 nested page table、reverse map metadata、replay/alias 和 malicious host 风险。</li>
      <li>Host-controlled metadata 可能泄露或篡改 VM 状态。</li>
      <li>需要硬件级 memory ownership 和 integrity 保护。</li>
      </ul>
- elementId: sep-line
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 330, 1160, 1]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $border
- elementId: sol-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 350, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
- elementId: sol-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 390, 1160, 260]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <ul>
      <li>引入 Secure Nested Paging 替代传统 nested paging。</li>
      <li>Reverse Map Table (RMP) 提供 memory ownership metadata。</li>
      <li>Integrity-oriented VM isolation controls 减少 host 对 VM 内存元数据的控制。</li>
      </ul>
- elementId: source
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 14
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.2
    wrap: True
    text: |
      来源：AMD SEV-SNP industry memory-integrity evidence｜证据等级：E4 / Industry evidence
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
